## 思路

**贪心**:累加全程净油量 `total`,若 `total < 0` 一定无解;否则从某点出发,维护当前油箱 `tank`,一旦 `tank < 0` 就把起点换到下一站并清零 tank。最终起点即为答案。

## 参考代码

```js
function canCompleteCircuit(gas, cost) {
  let total = 0;
  let tank = 0;
  let start = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < gas.length; i++) {
    const diff = gas[i] - cost[i];
    total += diff;
    tank += diff;
    if (tank < 0) {
      start = i + 1;
      tank = 0;
    }
  }
  return total >= 0 ? start : -1;
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(n)
- 空间:O(1)
